<title>PHILIPPINES: Empire East says to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Empire East says to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Empire East Land Holdings Inc said on Friday its board had approved a buy back of its shares.</p>
<p>In its meeting on Thursday, the Empire board &quot;resolved to authorise the corporation to purchase its own shares as treasury stock, under such terms and conditions as may be deemed beneficial to the corporation,&quot; assistant corporate secretary Maria Rosario Aranguren said in a statement.  </p>
<p>The company did not give details of the shares buy back plan. -- MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 841-8936</p>
</text>
